"mentor"}]},{"title":"Service","intro":"A coven is kept by its members. Give your craft and your time to the circle.","min_days":0,"passed_by":"mentor","tasks":[{"title":"Write a page for the coven’s book","kind":"book","instructions":"Write a page for the coven’s Book of Shadows on something you’ve learned this year: a working, a recipe, a piece of lore. Send it for approval.","times":1,"response":"none","checked_by":"manager"},{"title":"Serve at coven rites","kind":"service","instructions":"Help prepare and clear away at two coven rites: setting the altar, bringing what’s needed, welcoming others.","times":2,"response":"none","checked_by":"mentor"},{"title":"Lead a part of a ritual","kind":"ritual","instructions":"Take one part of a coven ritual: calling a quarter, leading a chant, a reading, lighting the altar.","times":1,"response":"none","checked_by":"mentor"},{"title":"A service to the wider community","kind":"service","instructions":"Do something for people or land beyond the coven: a clean-up, a donation, help for someone in need. Write what you did.","times":1,"response":"text","checked_by":"mentor","optional":true}]},{"title":"Dedication and initiation","intro":"The end of the year and a day. You and the coven’s leaders decide together that you are ready.","min_days":0,"passed_by":"manager","tasks":[{"title":"A final conversation with your mentor","kind":"meeting","instructions":"Look back on the year with your mentor: what changed, what’s still to learn, and whether you are ready.","times":1,"response":"none","checked_by":"mentor"},{"title":"Write your oath","kind":"oath","instructions":"Write the oath you will take at your initiation, in your own words, and share it with the coven’s leaders.","times":1,"response":"text","checked_by":"manager"},{"title":"Initiation","kind":"ritual","instructions":"Your initiation into the coven, held by its leaders in the way of the Wheel of the Year.","times":1,"response":"none","checked_by":"manager"}]}]'::jsonb, 2)
